FACTORY QUOTES FOR LUNCH BOX
RFQ responses from three shortlisted factories for insulated lunch box

REQUEST: 60,000 units insulated lunch box, target cost £3.20 FOB

FACTORY A QUOTE:
Unit cost: £3.05 FOB
Lead time: 12 weeks
Tooling cost: £45,000 (amortized: £0.75/unit at 60k)
Capability: Excellent, full insulation capability
Quality record: ISO 9001, 0.8% defect rate
Compliance: Full environmental and labor certifications

FACTORY B QUOTE:
Unit cost: £3.18 FOB
Lead time: 14 weeks
Tooling cost: £32,000 (amortized: £0.53/unit at 60k)
Capability: Good, proven lunch box manufacturing
Quality record: ISO 9001, 1.2% defect rate
Compliance: Partial certifications, audit recommended

FACTORY C QUOTE:
Unit cost: £3.45 FOB
Lead time: 18 weeks
Tooling cost: £28,000 (amortized: £0.47/unit at 60k)
Capability: Basic capability, new to lunch box category
Quality record: No standard certification, audit required
Compliance: Minimal documentation

SUMMARY:
Factory A has lowest total cost and best compliance
Factory B offers best tooling amortization
Factory C carries highest risks
